  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Grass Carp.png|200px|left|Grass carp]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Animals|Animal]]\n |level = 27\n |lures = {{Infoicon|greenl|big|link=Lure}} {{Infoicon|purplel|big|link=Lure}}\n |spots = 2\n |circle = small\n |xp = 12\n}}\n'''Grass carps''' are a type of [[fish]].\n\nLike all types of fish, each grass carp gives one [[Fish Fillet|fish fillet]] when caught.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Catching grass carps'''===\nGrass carps can only be caught with green and purple [[lure]]s in fishing spot #2 (the reedy area with some water lilies).\n\nGrass carps can be caught in small circles and therefore are harder to catch.\n\n[[File:FishingMap Names.png|350px|left]]\n\n{{Clr}}\nSee [[Fishing List]] for more detailed information.\n----\n==='''Grass carps in the fishing book'''===\n[[File:Grass Carp Photo.png|150px|left|Fishing book photo]]\nThe Grass carp is on page 14 of the [[Fishing Book|fishing book]]:\n\n''This vegetarian fish leads a simple, healthy life. Tip: Does not like worms!''\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''See also'''===\n{{FishMenu}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Graskarpfen\n|es = Carpa china\n|no = Gresskarpe\n}}\n[[Category:Fish]]",
